svt-jpeg-xs: svt-jpeg-xs (Intel JPEG-XS Library)
svt-jpeg-xs:
svt-jpeg-xs: The JPEG XS (ISO/IEC 21122) standard specifies a compression
svt-jpeg-xs: technology with an end-to-end latency of a few lines, at a low
svt-jpeg-xs: implementation complexity. For example, this allows hardware
svt-jpeg-xs: implementations that do not require external memory.JPEG XS excels
svt-jpeg-xs: with high multi-generation robustness and is particularly optimized
svt-jpeg-xs: for visual lossless compression as defined in ISO/IEC 29170-2 for
svt-jpeg-xs: both natural and synthetic images.
